5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited! I want to see who we can actually get to help these companies, so I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I believe we should look at the actual history of our returns. I'll examine the profile of the exits and the write-off and the account retention through price rises.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's be pragmatic about our wallet. I'm going to look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know why the end of the quarter is so stressful! I'll check the appraisal needs at the last audit and the independent checks on holdings' reported figures.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am interested in the obstacles that cause delays. I will look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
